# The four container-level detector cases. Each is split into `#[ignore]` phases in its own test
# binary and sequenced HERE, because only hub-pg.sh can promote a standby, kill a container, copy a
# volume or replay an archive, and a `gr` test container has no docker. The phases pass their
# state through $GM_HUB_STEP_DIR/<case>.json; no phase waits on a peer.
